# The siege arm with a real air answer: mechMissile joins the mix.
#
# Every VH equilibrium (log 2026-07-31) has the enemy's air flying over a
# fist whose only answer is the hoverTank's 140 reach. mechMissile is the
# dedicated instrument: 190 reach, air-only, a walker's hit points, tier
# one behind a single mechFactory the plan inserts by itself. In the goals
# means in the sustained mix, and the counter tilts toward it the moment
# aircraft show -- it is the one air-capable type with reach to spare.

name aa-counter-guard-arty-mm
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank,c_artillery,mechMissile
heavies none
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
expand 1
counter 1
navtilt 0
cover 0
intercept 1
guard_cap 0
aa_cover 0
forward 0
scout 0
